<tr><td>Behaviour</td><td>Tap plays/pauses (click sound + haptic; button scales to 0.95 on press). At rest the first 6 bars are lit teal; while playing the lit bars follow the clip position (grey <code>#D5DADF</code> otherwise, 150 ms colour fade). The time counts <b>down</b> while playing. When the clip ends it resets. Follows the mute toggle. A missing or blocked clip just leaves the button as it was.</td></tr>
