<!-- ===================================================== 10 -->
<h2>10. Known notes and gaps found in the code</h2>
<div class="note"><b>These are observations from reading the source, not changes.</b></div>
<ol>
  <li><b>Missing audio:</b> step 9 plays <code>/audios/level-two/meet-the-command.mp3</code>, but <code>public/audios/level-two/</code> does not exist. The player renders and counts down a 4 s default, but tapping play does nothing audible.</li>
  <li><b>Stale comments in <code>page.tsx</code>:</b> the step 4 comment says "Robot has picked it up!" but the screen's title is "Let's release the cube."; the step 5 comment says "What will happen next?" but its title is "It's your turn now!". The behaviour is correct; only the comments are out of date.</li>
  <li><b>Unused quizzes:</b> <code>LETS_PICK_UP</code> and <code>WILL_REACH</code> are defined (WILL_REACH even says "Screen 18") but are not in the flow.</li>
  <li><b>Video is a mock:</b> step 15's play button only plays the click sound; the player bar is static art.</li>
  <li><b>Time on Lesson Complete is fixed</b> at 3:42 (222 s) and XP at +40; neither is measured.</li>
  <li><b>Screen 6 is not graded</b> and has no confetti/XP; it uses the progress bar's correct/wrong reaction only (no strike for non-final pairs).</li>
  <li><b>Hint count</b> is fixed at 1 and is not consumed.</li>
  <li><b>Light only:</b> dark-mode classes exist in many components, but the module forces light theme for now.</li>
</ol>

<p class="meta">End of document.</p>
</body>
</html>
